@baseUrl = http://localhost:5090

### Create order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalOrderId": "SHOP-2026-4711",
  "customerNumber": "C10001",
  "customerName": "Example Customer",
  "items": [
    {
      "productNumber": "ART-100",
      "description": "Mechanical Keyboard",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 129.90
    }
  ]
}

### Replace with the id returned above
@orderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Get order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### Validate
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/validate

### Approve
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/approve

### Start processing
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/start-processing

### Complete
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/complete

### History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/history
